<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The fourteen domains of the gods (Gods/GodDefs.cs, GodDomainDef; docs/design/gods.md, "Domains"). For each: what its
    gods are gods of ("goddess of the harvest"), two colours, its symbol (Tools/make_god_symbols.py, white on transparent,
    tinted in a god's colours), the names Rimfolk's makers give its gods in each age (a tribe's spirits, the medieval's old
    gods and saints, the industrial's half-forgotten and machine gods, spacers' archotechs), its epithets (a noun phrase
    after the name, "the Bringer of Rain"), the name of a god of it born of the colony's own faith, and its sacred things:
    animal kinds and plants by defName (the game's and the player's active mods', looked up softly), a place and a deed.
    The names avoid the patrons' own (Defs/GodDefs/Rimfolk_Pantheon_Patrons.xml).
  -->

